  fullText: 'Premou has taken our only surface gear, which should have enough\nwater
    to exit the caves.                                                                                                                                                                                       
    \nWe wrote a document with our story and everything we know of this\ninvasion.
    Maybe one day some other advanced species might find it\nso that we are not forgotten.                                                                                                                                                                                       
    \nIf that happens, I hope it serves as a warning to save others.                                                                                            '
